sec.p:
We report several key findings in this meta‐analysis (Figure

S2
): first, FCM compared with placebo significantly reduced the composite endpoint of recurrent heart failure hospitalization and cardiovascular death in iron deficient heart failure patients. These results were mainly driven by reduction in recurrent heart failure hospitalizations. Second, while FCM strongly reduced the risk of recurrent heart failure hospitalizations, no beneficial effect on all‐cause or cardiovascular mortality was observed in iron deficient heart failure patients.
